{#
  BeMart admin Tax-rule list — EC-CUBE goTaxRuleList (税率設定).

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 admin-theme `Setting/Shop/tax_rule.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/admin/Setting/Shop/tax_rule.twig).

  Setting/Shop section, LIST + inline-FORM page. It extends the admin
  frame (`admin-base.html.twig`, the port of EC-CUBE's admin
  `default_frame.twig`), not the storefront `base.html.twig`. The markup
  skeleton + `c-*` / `ec-*` / Bootstrap classes are kept verbatim from
  EC-CUBE; only the dynamic bindings are rebound to the TaxRuleList
  resource body (src/Resource/Page/Admin/TaxRule/TaxRuleList.php — body
  carries `count` + `taxRules` (a list of {taxRuleId, taxRate,
  roundingType, applyDate}) and an AdminTaxRuleForm exposed as `form`).

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (see var/templates/README.md, "Admin pages"):
   - `{{ 'key'|trans }}`  -> the ja literal from messages.ja.yaml.
   - `canonical-url route, params)` -> deterministic `/{route}?{query}`
     (`BeMartTwigExtension`).
   - `form_widget(form.taxRate)` / `form.applyDate` ->
     `form.input('taxRate')` / `form.input('applyDate')` — the real
     AdminTaxRuleForm inline-create inputs (Ray.WebFormModule).
   - `form_widget(form._token)` -> EC-CUBE per-request CSRF widget. The
     hidden `_token` input is kept (structure) with an empty value;
     EC-CUBE-runtime only — enumerated as residual.
   - `form_widget(form.rounding_type)` -> the 課税規則 select is backed
     by the `mtb_rounding_type` master-data table; AdminTaxRuleListFetched
     carries `roundingType` only as a bare int with no joined option set,
     so AdminTaxRuleForm omits the control. The 課税規則 cell renders
     without an input. FLAGGED missing-body-field — enumerated as residual.
   - `{% for TaxRule in TaxRules %}` -> the resource body's `taxRules`
     list. EC-CUBE keys the row + actions by `TaxRule.id`; the projection
     surfaces `taxRuleId`, so BeMart keys the row + actions by `taxRuleId`.
   - per-row `forms[TaxRule.id]` inline-EDIT form -> ALPS exposes no
     `doUpdateTaxRule` (edits flow as delete-then-create — see the
     TaxRule resource docblock), so the resource carries no per-row edit
     form. The `edit` panel keeps EC-CUBE's structure but renders the
     persisted row values as plain text; the `mode`/`tax_rule_id` hidden
     inputs and the `edit` controls have no BeMart submit target.
     Enumerated as residual.
   - `TaxRule.default_tax_rule` -> the AdminTaxRuleListFetched projection
     does NOT carry the default-tax-rule flag; the row always renders the
     editable / deletable path. FLAGGED missing-body-field.
   - `csrf_token_for_anchor()` on the delete `<a>` -> EC-CUBE per-request
     CSRF widget. OMITTED exactly as the storefront ports omit it.
   - the `errors` / `forms` per-row form-collection maps -> Symfony
     FormView runtime; dropped. The page renders no `has-error` state.
#}
{% extends 'admin-base.html.twig' %}

{% set route = 'admin-tax-rule-tax-rule-list' %}
{% set title = '税率設定' %}
{% set sub_title = '店舗設定' %}

{% block stylesheet %}
    <style type="text/css">
        .edit {
            display: none;
        }

        .has-error .list {
            display: none;
        }

        .has-error .edit {
            display: block;
        }
    </style>
{% endblock stylesheet %}

{% block javascript %}
    <script type="text/javascript">
        $(function() {
            $('.tax_rule_list_item td.action a.edit-button').click(function() {
                var id = $(this).data('id');
                var tr = $('#ex-tax_rule-' + id);
                $(tr).find('.list').hide();
                $(tr).find('.edit').show();
            });

            $('.tax_rule_list_item .cancel').click(function() {
                location.href = '/admin/tax-rule/tax-rule-list';
            });
        });
    </script>
{% endblock javascript %}

{% block main %}
    <div class="c-contentsArea__cols">
        <div class="c-contentsArea__primaryCol">
            <div class="c-primaryCol">
                <div class="card rounded border-0 mb-4">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <div class="d-inline-block" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="商品共通の税率を設定できます。新しい税率を追加することで基本税率設定を上書きすることが可能です。">
                            <span>税率設定</span>
                            <i class="fa fa-question-circle fa-lg ms-1"></i>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body p-0">
                        <table class="table tabel-sm">
                            <colgroup>
                                <col width="5%">
                                <col width="">
                                <col width="15%">
                                <col width="35%">
                                <col width="5%">
                                <col width="">
                            </colgroup>
                            <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-2 ps-3">ID</th>
                                <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-2 ps-3">税率</th>
                                <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-2 ps-3">課税規則</th>
                                <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-2 ps-3">適用日時</th>
                                <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-2 ps-3"></th>
                                <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-2 ps-3 pe-5"></th>
                            </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody>

                            <tr id="tax_rule_item_new">
                                <form name="form1" role="form" class="form-horizontal doCreateTaxRule" id="form1" method="post" action="/admin/tax-rule/tax-rule-list">
                                    <input type="hidden" id="tax_rule__token" name="csrfToken" value="{{ csrfToken|default(csrf_token()) }}">
                                    <td class="align-middle ps-3"></td>
                                    <td class="align-middle" style="width:230px;">
                                        <div class="input-group">
                                            {{ form.input('taxRate')|raw }}
                                            <div class="input-group-text">%</div>
                                        </div>
                                    </td>
                                    <td class="align-middle">
                                    </td>
                                    <td class="align-middle">
                                        {{ form.input('applyDate')|raw }}
                                    </td>
                                    <td class="align-middle"></td>
                                    <td class="align-middle pe-5">
                                        <div class="row justify-content-end">
                                            <button class="btn btn-ec-regular px-4" type="submit">新規作成</button>
                                        </div>
                                    </td>
                                </form>
                            </tr>

                            {% for TaxRule in taxRules %}
                                <tr id="ex-tax_rule-{{ TaxRule.taxRuleId }}" class="tax_rule_list_item">
                                    <form name="edit-form" id="edit-form_{{ TaxRule.taxRuleId }}" method="post" action="/admin/tax-rule/tax-rule-list">
                                        <input type="hidden" value="{{ TaxRule.taxRuleId }}" name="tax_rule_id">
                                        <input type="hidden" value="edit_inline" name="mode"/>
                                        <td class="align-middle ps-3"><span>{{ TaxRule.taxRuleId }}</span></td>
                                        <td class="align-middle text-end" style="width:230px;">
                                            <div class="list">
                                                <span class="col-6 text-end pe-0">{{ TaxRule.taxRate }}</span><span class="col-6 ps-1">%</span>
                                            </div>
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="align-middle">
                                            <div class="list">
                                                <span>{{ TaxRule.roundingType }}</span>
                                            </div>
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="align-middle">
                                            <div class="list">
                                                <span>{{ TaxRule.applyDate }}</span>
                                            </div>
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="align-middle">
                                            <div class="edit">
                                                <button type="submit" class="btn text-nowrap btn-ec-conversion">決定</button>
                                                <button type="button" class="btn text-nowrap btn-ec-sub cancel" data-id="{{ TaxRule.taxRuleId }}">キャンセル</button>
                                            </div>
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="align-middle action">
                                            <div class="col-12 col-sm-10 col-md-8 col-lg-6 float-end">
                                                <div class="row pe-2">
                                                    <div class="col-6 text-center pe-0"><a class="btn btn-ec-actionIcon edit-button" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-id="{{ TaxRule.taxRuleId }}" data-bs-placement="top" title="編集"><i class="fa fa-pencil fa-lg text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></div>

                                                    <div class="col-6 text-center">
                                                        <div class="d-inline-block me-3" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top"
                                                             title="削除">
                                                            <a class="btn btn-ec-actionIcon" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#DeleteModal_{{ TaxRule.taxRuleId }}">
                                                                <i class="fa fa-close fa-lg text-secondary"></i>
                                                            </a>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <!-- 削除モーダル -->
                                                        <div class="modal fade" id="DeleteModal_{{ TaxRule.taxRuleId }}" tabindex="-1" role="dialog"
                                                             aria-labelledby="DeleteModal_{{ TaxRule.taxRuleId }}" aria-hidden="true">
                                                            <div class="modal-dialog" role="document">
                                                                <div class="modal-content">
                                                                    <div class="modal-header">
                                                                        <h5 class="modal-title fw-bold">
                                                                            削除します
                                                                        </h5>
                                                                        <button class="btn-close" type="button" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                    <div class="modal-body text-start">
                                                                        <p class="text-start modal-message">この操作はあとから取り消すことができません。「{{ TaxRule.taxRuleId }}」を削除してよろしいですか？</p>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                    <div class="modal-footer">
                                                                        <button class="btn btn-ec-sub" type="button" data-bs-dismiss="modal">
                                                                            キャンセル
                                                                        </button>
                                                                        <a class="btn btn-ec-delete" href="/admin/tax-rule/tax-rule?taxRuleId={{ TaxRule.taxRuleId }}&_method=delete"
                                                                           data-confirm="false"
>
                                                                            削除
                                                                        </a>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </td>
                                    </form>
                                </tr>
                            {% endfor %}
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
